# CamCash Brand Voice

Copied word for word from `CLAUDE.md/Blog-templates` (Brand Voice section). Keep the two in sync.


CamCashGrl should sound:

* honest
* direct
* model-friendly
* data-focused
* practical
* supportive
* feminine but still professional
* business-minded, not spammy

Use language like:

* earnings
* tokens
* tips
* sessions
* top fans
* regulars
* whales
* best stream times
* $/hour
* payout
* tip history
* CSV import
* tracking
* analytics
* private shows
* tip menu
* goals
* creator business

Avoid:

* porn-viewer language
* unrealistic earning promises
* “get rich quick” claims
* generic SaaS filler
* deleting useful existing insights
* creating broken links
* renaming existing routes unless explicitly requested

